  "label": "Historical Context of Slavery",
  "description": "To fully understand the image, one must know that slavery was not merely an isolated act of violence but a systemic institution that involved forced labor, separation of families, denial of legal rights, and racialized violence. The image depicts only one moment of brutality within a much larger, centuries-long system of oppression. Without this context, the image can be misinterpreted as a singular, isolated event rather than a symptom of a broader historical injustice.",
